{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alchemixum is a cute lil' mixing game!<br>Mix elements starting from the four basic &quot;air, earth, fire and water&quot; and discover hundreds of combinations, and complete the Alchemixum. But not to worry, you won't be alone because you're part of a crew of space alchemists, them being: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Canva, a little hyperactive fairy who will help you with the game's customization, occasionally telling you jokes to lighten the mood...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gaze, a studious critter who will help you progress further giving you hints towards element combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And Figura, she will assist you with the game's settings and some more technical things, make sure to report any bugs you may encounter to her!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of elements to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several quality of life features based on feedback from other games from the same genre</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scenery mode, resize, rotate and rearrange elements to create cute little scenes or goofy lookin' monstrosities using the stickers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new options of wallpaper for the mixing area and music for the game by discovering new elements!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is still under development so a lot might and will change!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3548800?t=1768611110","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548800/36d530e0ff9b1014c42fc5e47598d8513596e5c2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768611110","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548800/e9295c70722e6b1b8a06fbecfae3efeff333b447/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768611110","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548800/e9295c70722e6b1b8a06fbecfae3efeff333b447/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768611110","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alchemixum is a cute lil' mixing game!<br>Mix elements starting from the four basic &quot;air, earth, fire and water&quot; and discover hundreds of combinations, and complete the Alchemixum. But not to worry, you won't be alone because you're part of a crew of space alchemists, them being: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Canva, a little hyperactive fairy who will help you with the game's customization, occasionally telling you jokes to lighten the mood...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gaze, a studious critter who will help you progress further giving you hints towards element combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And Figura, she will assist you with the game's settings and some more technical things, make sure to report any bugs you may encounter to her!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of elements to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several quality of life features based on feedback from other games from the same genre</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scenery mode, resize, rotate and rearrange elements to create cute little scenes or goofy lookin' monstrosities using the stickers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new options of wallpaper for the mixing area and music for the game by discovering new elements!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is still under development so a lot might and will change!</strong></p>","developers":["HiveSlime"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548800/372533d13ef336e3d43b1f17bb98fdad40aa33ea/header.jpg?t=1768611110","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3548800/1825719909/0da0126364cfb2ed7b3c567dd1fa3833ee727096/1768596075/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768597924","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3548800/1825719909/0da0126364cfb2ed7b3c567dd1fa3833ee727096/1768596075/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768597924","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3548800/1825719909/0da0126364cfb2ed7b3c567dd1fa3833ee727096/1768596075/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1768597924","id":257266412,"name":"ALCHEMIXUM - Coming Soon","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257266412/47cc4435b2e15bad9f34bd4560a2a06d6d5be6c0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1768597924"}],"name":"ALCHEMIXUM","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-5200U<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel\u00ae HD Graphics 620<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 8<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["HiveSlime"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia Cartoon.","rating":"12","required_age":"12"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Schimpfw\u00f6rte\nFantasy-Gewalt",